          "description": "Open a dispute when delivery is missing, incorrect, incomplete, or violates the verification criteria. Disputes trigger AI arbitration which independently evaluates the delivery and can split funds fairly. Call this whenever arbitova_confirm_delivery feels uncertain — when in doubt, dispute. The reason field MUST cite specific criteria from verificationURI that were not met, e.g.",
